# Save a card without bank authentication

Collect card details in your mobile app and charge your customer at a later time.

## Index

This article has multiple variants. Fetch one of the following URLs to view specific content for your use case:

- [iOS](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/mobile/save-card-without-authentication.md?platform=ios)
- [Android](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/mobile/save-card-without-authentication.md?platform=android)
- [React Native](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/mobile/save-card-without-authentication.md?platform=react-native)
